it.\\\",\n   \\\"The removed leader remains at its old term only while nothing from the current configuration carries a higher term to it; with CheckQuorum or PreVote enabled the current leader answers the stale heartbeat with its higher term and the removed leader steps down, which bounds the window but does not remove the stale answers issued before that.\\\",\n   \\\"Only the declared probe has been run natively so far; the retained receipt for this harness is still outstanding, and no bound is claimed for how long a client that never retries elsewhere stays exposed.\\\"]}]}\nu[\\\"experiment\\\"]=exp\nopen('update3.json','w').write(json.dumps(u,indent=2)+\\\"\\\\n\\\")\nPY\n/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-15_13-42-19-etcd_raft-real-run --submission update3.json 2>&1 | tail -8\"","aggregated_output":"{\"valid\": true, \"run_id\": \"10b3ddfa3d914121bb0b6c1901d393f6\", \"elapsed_seconds\": 1022.1037201890067, \"diagnostics\": [], \"meaning\": \"Read-only validation of these bytes and saved state; no acceptance, execution or budget reservation\", \"no_change\": false, \"execution_requested\": true, \"effects\": [{\"object\": \"sources\", \"action\": \"create\", \"target\": \"tracker-singleton\"}, {\"object\": \"sources\", \"action\": \"create\", \"target\": \"readindex-singleton-branch\"}, {\"object\": \"sources\", \"action\": \"create\", \"target\": \"stepleader-decl\"}, {\"object\": \"sources\", \"action\": \"create\", \"target\": \"prop-removed-leader\"}, {\"object\": \"sources\", \"action\": \"create\", \"target\": \"switchtoconfig-removal\"}, {\"object\": \"sources\", \"action\": \"create\", \"target\": \"config-stepdown-doc\"}, {\"object\": \"sources\", \"action\": \"create\", \"target\": \"readonlysafe-doc\"